<h1 id=3D"id-=EB=8B=A4=EA=B5=AD=EC=96=B4=EC=9D=8C=EC=84=B1=EB=B0=9C=EC=84=
=B1=EC=A1=B0=ED=95=A9-=EC=98=81=EB=AC=B8(English)">=EC=98=81=EB=AC=B8(Engli=
sh)</h1>
<ul>
<li>
<p>After %d meters, Turn right / <span style=3D"background-color: rgb(220,2=
23,228);">audio_m_a + audio_right</span></p></li>
<li>
<p>After %d meters, Turn left / <span style=3D"background-color: rgb(220,22=
3,228);">audio_m_a + audio_left</span></p></li>
<li>
<p>After %d meters, Keep right / <span style=3D"background-color: rgb(220,2=
23,228);">audio_m_a + audio_right_way</span></p></li>
<li>
<p>After %d meters, Keep left / <span style=3D"background-color: rgb(220,22=
3,228);">audio_m_a + audio_left_way</span></p></li>
<li>
<p>After %d meters, Continue straight for now / <span style=3D"background-c=
olor: rgb(220,223,228);">audio_m_a + audio_straight_2</span></p></li>
<li>
<p>After %d meters, Make a U-turn / <span style=3D"background-color: rgb(22=
0,223,228);">audio_m_a + audio_u_turn_1</span></p></li>
<li>
<p>After %d meters, Enter the roundabout. / <span style=3D"background-color=
: rgb(220,223,228);">audio_m_a + audio_round</span></p></li>
<li>
<p>After %d meters, Take the exit. / <span style=3D"background-color: rgb(2=
20,223,228);">audio_m_a + audio_exit_2</span></p></li>
<li>
<p>After %d meters, Pass through the tollgate. / <span style=3D"background-=
color: rgb(220,223,228);">audio_m_a + audio_gate</span></p></li>
<li>
<p>After %d meters, Take the entrance ramp. / <span style=3D"background-col=
or: rgb(220,223,228);">audio_m_a + audio_ramp</span></p></li>
<li>
<p>After %d meters, Take the highway. / <span style=3D"background-color: rg=
b(220,223,228);">audio_m_a + audio_highway</span></p></li>
<li>
<p>After %d meters, Switch to the parallel road. / <span style=3D"backgroun=
d-color: rgb(220,223,228);">audio_m_a + audio_paralled</span></p></li>
<li>
<p>Then After %d meters, Turn right. / <span style=3D"background-color: rgb=
(220,223,228);">audio_and + audio_m_a + audio_right</span></p></li>
<li>
<p>Then After %d meters, Continue straight for now. / <span style=3D"backgr=
ound-color: rgb(220,223,228);">audio_and + audio_m_a + audio_straight_2</sp=
an></p></li>
<li>
<p>Then After %d meters, Pass through the tollgate. / <span style=3D"backgr=
ound-color: rgb(220,223,228);">audio_and + audio_m_a +audio_gate</span></p>=
</li>
<li>
<p>Then For %d meters, Continue straight for now. / <span style=3D"backgrou=
nd-color: rgb(220,223,228);">audio_and + audio_for_m + audio_straight_2</sp=
an></p></li>
<li>
<p>Then Toward %s, Turn right / <span style=3D"background-color: rgb(220,22=
3,228);">audio_and + audio_toward + audio_right</span></p></li>
<li>
<p>Then Take the first exit. / <span style=3D"background-color: rgb(220,223=
,228);">audio_and + audio_exit_first</span></p></li>
<li>
<p>Then Take the first right. / <span style=3D"background-color: rgb(220,22=
3,228);">audio_and + audio_right_first</span></p></li>
<li>
<p>Then You have reached your destination. / <span style=3D"background-colo=
r: rgb(220,223,228);">audio_and + audio_arrive_near</span></p></li>
<li>
<p>Then You have reached your waypoint. / <span style=3D"background-color: =
rgb(220,223,228);">audio_and + audio_waypoint</span></p></li>
<li>
<p>Soon Turn right / <span style=3D"background-color: rgb(220,223,228);">au=
dio_soon + audio_right</span></p></li>
<li>
<p>Soon Keep right / <span style=3D"background-color: rgb(220,223,228);">au=
dio_soon + audio_right_way</span></p></li>
<li>
<p>Soon Make a U-turn. / <span style=3D"background-color: rgb(220,223,228);=
">audio_soon + audio_u_turn_1</span></p></li>
<li>
<p>Soon Enter the roundabout. / <span style=3D"background-color: rgb(220,22=
